{
  "story_id": "last-chapter",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 237312,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Toby went to see his grandmother on Sunday.",
      "start_ms": 1579,
      "end_ms": 4117
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Riverside Manor was quieter than he had expected.",
      "start_ms": 4117,
      "end_ms": 6936
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "There were paintings on the walls and armchairs in the hallway and someone was playing a piano, badly, in another room.",
      "start_ms": 6936,
      "end_ms": 13760
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Grandma Ada was in her room, in a chair by the window.",
      "start_ms": 13760,
      "end_ms": 16861
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "She was watching a squirrel on the grass outside.",
      "start_ms": 16861,
      "end_ms": 19681
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "When Toby came in she looked up and, for a small terrible second, Toby was not sure she recognized him.",
      "start_ms": 19681,
      "end_ms": 25602
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Then her face lit up.",
      "start_ms": 25602,
      "end_ms": 26899
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "\"Toby,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 26899,
      "end_ms": 27914
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "\"Oh, my Toby.",
      "start_ms": 27914,
      "end_ms": 28704
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Come sit.\"",
      "start_ms": 28704,
      "end_ms": 29380
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Toby sat on the little bench beside her chair.",
      "start_ms": 29380,
      "end_ms": 32087
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "He had brought the manuscript.",
      "start_ms": 32087,
      "end_ms": 33835
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "He put it on his lap.",
      "start_ms": 33835,
      "end_ms": 35132
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "\"Grandma,\" he said, \"did you write this?\"",
      "start_ms": 35132,
      "end_ms": 37557
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Grandma Ada looked at the manuscript.",
      "start_ms": 37557,
      "end_ms": 39700
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "She reached out and touched the yellowed cover with two fingers.",
      "start_ms": 39700,
      "end_ms": 43365
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "She smiled — not a big smile, but a slow one, like remembering an old friend.",
      "start_ms": 43365,
      "end_ms": 47820
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 47820,
      "end_ms": 48779
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "\"I wrote it a long time ago.\"",
      "start_ms": 48779,
      "end_ms": 50527
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "\"Grandma, it's about me.",
      "start_ms": 50527,
      "end_ms": 51937
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "It's about my life.",
      "start_ms": 51937,
      "end_ms": 53065
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "The boy in the book is me.\"",
      "start_ms": 53065,
      "end_ms": 54700
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 54700,
      "end_ms": 55659
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "\"I thought it might be.\"",
      "start_ms": 55659,
      "end_ms": 57125
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Toby waited.",
      "start_ms": 57125,
      "end_ms": 57858
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "He was not sure what to ask next.",
      "start_ms": 57858,
      "end_ms": 59832
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Grandma Ada looked out the window.",
      "start_ms": 59832,
      "end_ms": 61806
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "The squirrel had gone.",
      "start_ms": 61806,
      "end_ms": 63159
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "\"I never had a plot for it,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 63159,
      "end_ms": 65358
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "\"I started writing about a boy.",
      "start_ms": 65358,
      "end_ms": 67163
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I did not know who he was.",
      "start_ms": 67163,
      "end_ms": 68685
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "He came into my head one afternoon in 1998 and he would not leave.",
      "start_ms": 68685,
      "end_ms": 72464
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He had a dog and a father who drove trains and a problem he was not telling anyone about.",
      "start_ms": 72464,
      "end_ms": 77539
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I wrote him down.\"",
      "start_ms": 77539,
      "end_ms": 78667
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "She looked at Toby.",
      "start_ms": 78667,
      "end_ms": 79851
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "\"And then years later,\" she said, \"you were born.",
      "start_ms": 79851,
      "end_ms": 82671
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "And it was you.",
      "start_ms": 82671,
      "end_ms": 83573
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Isn't that funny.\"",
      "start_ms": 83573,
      "end_ms": 84701
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "\"Grandma, that isn't possible.\"",
      "start_ms": 84701,
      "end_ms": 86562
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "\"No,\" she agreed.",
      "start_ms": 86562,
      "end_ms": 87577
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "\"It isn't.",
      "start_ms": 87577,
      "end_ms": 88197
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "But it happened.\"",
      "start_ms": 88197,
      "end_ms": 89268
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Toby did not know what to do with that.",
      "start_ms": 89268,
      "end_ms": 91524
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "He turned the manuscript over in his lap.",
      "start_ms": 91524,
      "end_ms": 93949
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "\"Grandma.",
      "start_ms": 93949,
      "end_ms": 94513
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "The last chapter.",
      "start_ms": 94513,
      "end_ms": 95528
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Chapter Twelve.",
      "start_ms": 95528,
      "end_ms": 96430
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "It's blank.\"",
      "start_ms": 96430,
      "end_ms": 97220
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "\"I know.\"",
      "start_ms": 97220,
      "end_ms": 97840
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "\"There's a note.",
      "start_ms": 97840,
      "end_ms": 98799
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "It says FINISH THIS WHEN YOU KNOW HOW.\"",
      "start_ms": 98799,
      "end_ms": 101111
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Grandma Ada nodded slowly.",
      "start_ms": 101111,
      "end_ms": 102633
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "She patted Toby's hand.",
      "start_ms": 102633,
      "end_ms": 104043
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "\"That chapter,\" she said, \"was never mine to write.",
      "start_ms": 104043,
      "end_ms": 106976
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "That's your chapter, Toby.",
      "start_ms": 106976,
      "end_ms": 108498
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "It always was.\"",
      "start_ms": 108498,
      "end_ms": 109344
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Toby went home.",
      "start_ms": 109344,
      "end_ms": 110400
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "He took the manuscript to his room.",
      "start_ms": 110400,
      "end_ms": 112778
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "He turned to the blank page marked CHAPTER 12.",
      "start_ms": 112778,
      "end_ms": 115947
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "He got a pencil.",
      "start_ms": 115947,
      "end_ms": 117136
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "He thought about the boy in the book, at the kitchen table with his father, halfway through a sentence.",
      "start_ms": 117136,
      "end_ms": 124069
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Then he wrote:",
      "start_ms": 124069,
      "end_ms": 125125
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Toby looked at his father across the table.",
      "start_ms": 125125,
      "end_ms": 128031
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "His father was reading the newspaper.",
      "start_ms": 128031,
      "end_ms": 130540
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "It was Tuesday night.",
      "start_ms": 130540,
      "end_ms": 131993
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Waffle was under the table with her chin on Toby's shoe.",
      "start_ms": 131993,
      "end_ms": 135822
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "\"Dad,\" said Toby.",
      "start_ms": 135822,
      "end_ms": 137011
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "\"I need to talk to you about something.\"",
      "start_ms": 137011,
      "end_ms": 139784
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "His father put down the paper.",
      "start_ms": 139784,
      "end_ms": 141831
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "\"Okay,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 141831,
      "end_ms": 142954
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "\"I'm listening.\"",
      "start_ms": 142954,
      "end_ms": 144142
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Toby wrote for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 144142,
      "end_ms": 146057
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "He wrote about Ryan Callahan.",
      "start_ms": 146057,
      "end_ms": 148038
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "He wrote about how it felt to walk into school on Mondays.",
      "start_ms": 148038,
      "end_ms": 151934
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "He wrote about the things he had never told anyone, and how the boy in the book — the boy that was him — was going to say them out loud.",
      "start_ms": 151934,
      "end_ms": 161046
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "It took twelve pages.",
      "start_ms": 161046,
      "end_ms": 162499
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Toby's hand hurt when he was done.",
      "start_ms": 162499,
      "end_ms": 164876
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "That night at dinner, he did not eat much.",
      "start_ms": 164876,
      "end_ms": 167781
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "He looked at his father, who was passing him the mashed potatoes.",
      "start_ms": 167781,
      "end_ms": 172205
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "\"Dad,\" said Toby.",
      "start_ms": 172205,
      "end_ms": 173394
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "\"Can I talk to you about something after dinner?\"",
      "start_ms": 173394,
      "end_ms": 176762
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "His father looked at him.",
      "start_ms": 176762,
      "end_ms": 178478
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Not surprised.",
      "start_ms": 178478,
      "end_ms": 179469
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Just paying attention.",
      "start_ms": 179469,
      "end_ms": 181054
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "\"Sure, buddy.",
      "start_ms": 181054,
      "end_ms": 181978
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Of course.\"",
      "start_ms": 181978,
      "end_ms": 182836
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Toby brought the finished manuscript to Grandma Ada the next Sunday.",
      "start_ms": 182836,
      "end_ms": 187393
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "He had made a copy, on the copier at his mother's library, and had the copy bound with a spiral binding.",
      "start_ms": 187393,
      "end_ms": 194392
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Grandma Ada opened it to Chapter 12.",
      "start_ms": 194392,
      "end_ms": 196835
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "She read slowly.",
      "start_ms": 196835,
      "end_ms": 197958
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "When she finished, she closed the manuscript and held it against her chest.",
      "start_ms": 197958,
      "end_ms": 203042
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "\"It's a very good chapter,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 203042,
      "end_ms": 205551
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "\"You did it right.\"",
      "start_ms": 205551,
      "end_ms": 206938
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "\"Grandma.",
      "start_ms": 206938,
      "end_ms": 207598
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "How did you know?",
      "start_ms": 207598,
      "end_ms": 208787
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "How did you know all of it, from 1998?\"",
      "start_ms": 208787,
      "end_ms": 211494
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Grandma Ada thought about this for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 211494,
      "end_ms": 214795
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "She looked out the window.",
      "start_ms": 214795,
      "end_ms": 216644
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "\"I don't know how,\" she said finally.",
      "start_ms": 216644,
      "end_ms": 219153
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "\"But I think stories are older than the people who write them.",
      "start_ms": 219153,
      "end_ms": 223313
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Sometimes a story finds its person and it waits.",
      "start_ms": 223313,
      "end_ms": 226549
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "It waits until the person is ready to finish it.\"",
      "start_ms": 226549,
      "end_ms": 229917
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "She smiled at Toby.",
      "start_ms": 229917,
      "end_ms": 231303
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "\"You were the person for this one.",
      "start_ms": 231303,
      "end_ms": 233614
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "I was just the one who kept it warm until you got here.\"",
      "start_ms": 233614,
      "end_ms": 237312
    }
  ]
}